0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 403.00 Td (   - On Samples 2..3: Check if |x[k] - X_cand| <= 2.0 A.) Tj ET
0.063 0.725 0.506 rg
BT /F2 8 Tf 65.00 391.00 Td (     If YES: Consecutive_Count increases. When Count >= 3 -> GENUINE_LOAD_CHANGE!) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
