0.937 0.267 0.267 rg
BT /F2 8 Tf 65.00 367.00 Td (   - If NO: Signal collapsed back to baseline -> Confirmed SENSOR_NOISE_SPIKE!) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 355.00 Td (     Rejected by median filter; zero contactor chatter; 100% false-trip immunity.) Tj ET
